Validation vs pure-Python BFS: 20 random seed sets x depths 1..4 x 3 directions x (authored, all types)
    UNION form: 480 agree / 0 disagree; UNION ALL form (subset): 108 agree

`both` as a UNION ALL adjacency derived table vs an OR-join on vfs_edges: same answer, SQLite plans
    adjacency form == BFS: True; OR-join form == BFS: True
    plan, out direction (adjacency subquery flattened onto the fwd index):
       CO-ROUTINE walk
       SETUP
       SEARCH seed USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       RECURSIVE STEP
       SCAN w
       SEARCH vfs_edges USING COVERING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_vfs_edges_1 (source_id=?)
       SEARCH far USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       SCAN walk
       USE TEMP B-TREE FOR GROUP BY
    plan, both via UNION ALL adjacency:
       CO-ROUTINE walk
       SETUP
       SEARCH seed USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       RECURSIVE STEP
       CO-ROUTINE adj
       COMPOUND QUERY
       LEFT-MOST SUBQUERY
       SCAN vfs_edges USING COVERING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_vfs_edges_1
       UNION ALL
       SCAN vfs_edges USING COVERING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_vfs_edges_1
       SCAN w
       BLOOM FILTER ON adj (frm=?)
       SEARCH adj USING AUTOMATIC COVERING INDEX (frm=?)
       SEARCH far USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       SCAN walk
       USE TEMP B-TREE FOR GROUP BY
    plan, both via OR-join:
       CO-ROUTINE walk_or
       SETUP
       SEARCH seed USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       RECURSIVE STEP
       SCAN w
       MULTI-INDEX OR
       INDEX 1
       SEARCH vfs_edges USING COVERING INDEX sqlite_autoindex_vfs_edges_1 (source_id=?)
       INDEX 2
       SEARCH vfs_edges USING INDEX ix_vfs_edges_rev (target_id=? AND edge_type=?)
       SEARCH far USING INDEX ix_vfs_entries_entry_id (entry_id=?)
       SCAN walk_or
       USE TEMP B-TREE FOR GROUP BY

Rendered statement (out, depth 3, UNION, sqlite):
WITH RECURSIVE walk(node, depth) AS 
(SELECT seed.entry_id AS node, 0 AS depth 
FROM vfs_entries AS seed 
WHERE seed.deleted_at IS NULL AND seed.path != '/.vfs' AND seed.path NOT LIKE '/.vfs/%' ESCAPE '\' AND seed.entry_id IN ('01M4X1D2P9S24XE5PT4NN6D5ZH', '01M4X1D2NVMXT9WXSKKJNS092G') UNION SELECT adj."to" AS node, w.depth + 1 AS depth 
FROM walk AS w JOIN (SELECT vfs_edges.source_id AS frm, vfs_edges.target_id AS "to", vfs_edges.edge_type AS edge_type 
FROM vfs_edges 
WHERE vfs_edges.edge_type IN ('imports', 'references', 'calls')) AS adj ON adj.frm = w.node JOIN vfs_entries AS far ON far.entry_id = adj."to" 
WHERE w.depth < 3 AND far.deleted_at IS NULL AND far.path != '/.vfs' AND far.path NOT LIKE '/.vfs/%' ESCAPE '\')
 SELECT walk.node, min(walk.depth) AS depth 
FROM walk GROUP BY walk.node
